▶️ How to Run the Project

1️⃣ Install Required Libraries

pip install pandas numpy matplotlib

2️⃣ Open Jupyter Notebook

jupyter notebook

3️⃣ Open the Project File

Probability_Analysis_Project.ipynb

4️⃣ Run All Cells

